calcpad-rs is a Rust port of the CalcpadCE calculation engine
(https://github.com/imartincei/CalcpadCE, ported from commit 0cf438f).

The original C# code is distributed under the MIT License:

  Copyright (c) 2026 CalcpadCE Contributors
  Copyright (c) 2014-2026 Nedelcho Ganchovski

This port keeps the module structure of Calcpad.Core so that upstream changes
can be followed file by file. The port is distributed under the same MIT
License (see LICENSE).
